      "value": "According to discussions on the Discord server, this issue comes and goes at random for both Android and iOS users.\n\nThree Bean Soup suggested that it might be an issue with the UI button, and that the issue is already being tracked. See: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/1272887396249243723/1370127752551731240",
